{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.natsuha.cafe",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "喫茶店里一手哑铃一手书",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.natsuha.cafe",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.natsuha.cafe",
    "idolId": "natsuha",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（这样到下一个日程之前有一点时间了……喉咙也渴了……就去咖啡店吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……诶，坐在那边的是……）",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……夏葉？一手哑铃一手读书，惊到我了……",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "哎呀，制作人。这也不奇怪吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "光是学习的话，一只手就闲着了。而且我也想训练。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来如此，不愧是夏葉的热情啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "没那回事。因为，这种程度理所当然吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "为了成为顶点，必须比谁都要努力哦？一秒都不能浪费。顾不上什么体面。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "只是不想后悔，为自己做而已。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "我并没有什么才能，不如说还远远不够呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊。我也得向夏葉学习。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "……嗯，这里这样……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……听不见吗？好厉害的集中力。）",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "……说起来最近，觉得现在这个哑铃的重量不够了。要不再增加点次数吧……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "……啊，真是的。干脆书和哑铃合成一个就好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……呃，什么意思？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "哎呀，简单的事哦？现在这样，必须定期换手，那个时间就浪费了。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "但两个合成一个的话，不用换手也能同时学习和训练吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "一定会提高效率，训练量也能增加。对吧？不觉得是非常棒的事吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊、嗯……是吗？确实道理上没错。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "对吧！绝对是这样！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "……突然安静下来，怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不、不是……有点被夏葉的想象力震住了。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "我的想象力……？哎呀，是吗……比起那个，这之后有采访吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "差不多该走了，不然要赶不上了哦！",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，是啊。夏葉……好快……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（夏葉对偶像那么直接、那么拼命地向前走。）"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
